    "audioScript": "Keep the public elevator free from ten. It’s our only step-free route upstairs.\nThe freight elevator is free at ten thirty. We need both movers for twenty minutes; one leaves at eleven. Office first?\nLet’s not give the case a guided tour. Every handover needs a seal check. The driver can wait.\nAt eleven the room shows as available, and the display can run. Facilities inspects at eleven thirty.\nThe screen shows bookings. Reception needs Facilities clearance before admitting visitors to see displays.",
    "passage": "Woman: Keep the public elevator free from ten. It’s our only step-free route upstairs.\nMan: The freight elevator is free at ten thirty. We need both movers for twenty minutes; one leaves at eleven. Office first?\nWoman: Let’s not give the case a guided tour. Every handover needs a seal check. The driver can wait.\nMan: At eleven the room shows as available, and the display can run. Facilities inspects at eleven thirty.\nWoman: The screen shows bookings. Reception needs Facilities clearance before admitting visitors to see displays.",
    "passageZh": "女：從十點開始，客用電梯要空出來。那是唯一不用走樓梯就能上樓的路線。\n男：貨梯十點半才能用。搬運的二十分鐘裡，兩位搬運人員都要在場，其中一位十一點要走。我們能先把展示櫃搬進辦公室嗎？\n女：就別帶展示櫃到處『參觀』了。每次交接都要檢查封條。司機可以等。\n男：十一點時系統會顯示展示間可用。展示設備那時就能運作，但設施管理組十一點半才會來檢查。\n女：系統顯示的是預約狀態。訪客要進場看通電的展示設備，接待櫃檯得先收到設施管理組的核准。",
